Author: Tristan Mathias <github.gqmij@simplelogin.com>
Date:   Sat Oct 31 07:32:52 2026 -0700

    memos: a file's module and a module's files are in-process queries, not Records fields
    
    `module_names_of` and `files_of` were hand per-build memos; `module_at` and
    `module_listed` are context @queries over the same work, the listing a door read.
    
    STAND-IN: the count of admitted packages rides as a key argument (`_admitted`), because
    the package table has no door — admission pushes onto a Cell, which no query records. It
    goes when the package table is a @relation row set (admission inserts, readers read the
    relation — hd-families2's engine-side gap): the queries then read it and drop the argument.
    
    compiler/tests 1687/1687; shared store (the builder fills it, avra-try checks std-avrac and
    the cli over it twice) 0 errors.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
    Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QBqJuoi8EUrw37A8m4Qfto

